Fork multiply(C12, A11, B12).
Fork multiply(C21, A21, B11).
Fork multiply(C22, A21, B12).
Fork multiply(T11, A12, B21).
Fork multiply(T12, A12, B22).
Fork multiply(T21, A22, B21).
Fork multiply(T22, A22, B22).
